{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Then check its properties and move to destination. If not found, scan surrounding or wait. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanSurrounding    /> <Action ID = WaitForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
